<title>USA: PetsMart chairman to succeed resigning CEO.</title>
<headline>PetsMart chairman to succeed resigning CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PetsMart Inc said Friday that Mark Hansen has resigned as president, chief executive officer and as a company director, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Hansen resigned to join Wal-Mart as head of its Sam's Club unit.</p>
<p>PetsMart said Chairman Samuel Parker, who is also its former chief executive, will reassume the CEO role.</p>
</text>
